# The build context is an allowlist: only what the image is built from goes in. Everything else
# stays out by default, including .git, .env, CLAUDE.local.md, .venv, tests, docs, agent and tool
# directories (.beads, .claude, .codex, .cursor, .agents) and caches, so a new local file cannot
# reach an image layer by accident.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
# Named by pyproject.toml (readme, license-files): the wheel is built with them.
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/

# Never from inside src/ either.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
